## The Four Sentinels — hard rules

Non-AI guards at the perimeter. Bash + python only. No AI in any guard.

1. **Pre-Change Protocol Hook** — warns on edits to load-bearing files without prior KG query. Override: `<PROJECT_SLUG>_SKIP_PCP=1`.
2. **Schema-Verify** — blocks destructive DB ops against un-inspected tables. Override: `<PROJECT_SLUG>_SKIP_SCHEMA_CHECK=1`.
3. **Parity Check** — pre-commit gate; refuses if any two layers disagree. Override: `<PROJECT_SLUG>_SKIP_PARITY=1`.
4. **Knowledge-Graph Refresh** — auto-rebuilds the system map on meaningful commits. Override: `<PROJECT_SLUG>_SKIP_KG_REFRESH=1`.

When a Sentinel refuses: **almost never override.** Ask why it's right.

